sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner as Authenticated User
    participant ShareUI as ShareModal
    participant API as POST /api/v1/shares
    actor Public as Public Recipient
    participant PublicUI as PublicShareView

    Owner->>ShareUI: Click "Generate Share Link" (30 Days)
    ShareUI->>API: HTTP POST /api/v1/shares
    API-->>ShareUI: 201 Created { publicToken, shareUrl }
    ShareUI-->>Owner: Displays Copyable 256-Bit Link

    Public->>PublicUI: Open https://aayurface.com/share/shr_...
    PublicUI->>PublicUI: Load De-Identified Summary (100% PII & Photos Excluded)
    PublicUI-->>Public: Renders Redacted Ayurvedic Assessment
